    "Oracle shows a dense bundle of vertical slips at the top with supporting strokes and a table-like base beneath.",
    "Regular 典 compresses the writing-slip grid into the upper 曲-like structure and preserves the supporting lower strokes, still suggesting something formally displayed or set out."
